Package: ddnsd
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: dynamic DNS daemon for Cloudflare and No-IP
 ddnsd periodically finds this host's public IPv4 and IPv6 addresses, using
 HTTP echo services or the addresses of local network interfaces, and keeps
 the A and AAAA records of a domain pointed at them.
 .
 Supported DNS providers are Cloudflare and No-IP.
